# Slice C fixture: a `main` group made only of pattern-headed clauses is not selected as the entry point.
# Expected: only the top-level statements run; neither pattern clause executes.
@doc "Pattern-headed `main` clauses for `[\"a\"]` and `[\"b\"]`; a pattern-only group is never run by entry selection."
main(["a"]) = { print("A"); 1 }
main(["b"]) = { print("B"); 2 }
print("top")
42
